  <div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">About the publication</span><h1>Clear information. Better decisions.</h1><p>TechMintAI explains personal finance, artificial intelligence, fintech and everyday technology in practical English for a global audience.</p></header><div class="legal">
